# JOT.NET RayCastDemo map 01: a plain-text grid read by the demo.
# Full-line comments (#) and blank lines are ignored. Every other
# line must carry the same number of digits, where:
#
#   0 - open cell (walkable, rays pass through)
#   1 - border wall (every border cell must be a wall)
#   2 - pillar wall
#   3 - pillar wall
#
# The demo assigns each wall digit its own texture from
# assets/textures/materials; digits without an assigned texture fail
# loudly at startup.
#
# The demo fails loudly on malformed rows, unknown digits, ragged
# widths, or an open border: fix the file, do not guess.

1111111111111111
